\midrule
QwQ-32B & 0.036 & --- & --- & --- & --- & --- & --- \\
DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B & 0.05 & 70.0 & 70.0 & 66.7 & 66.7 & 68.3 & 68.3 \\
\bottomrule
\multicolumn{8}{l}{\footnotesize $^\dagger$ Expanded evaluation: 204 FOLIO + 600 ProofWriter = 804 questions. Others: 60 questions.} \\
