$K$ & SC Acc. & SICA Acc. & $\Delta$ (pp) & $C_0$ & Tie Rate \\
\midrule
6 & 70.0 & 71.7 & +1.7 & 0.40 & 15\% \\
8 & 70.0 & 73.3 & +3.3 & 0.47 & 22\% \\
